#descr "The term cambion was often used to describe any male humanoid that was a first-generation half-fiend. Researchers considered a true cambion having only come from the specific union of a planetouched mortal and a tanar'ri demon. Though unions with succubi or incubi were the likeliest parentage, the demons of Hellgate Keep were known to engage in forms of forced interbreeding. Orcs produced Tanarukk, elves produced Fey'ri, and humans produced Cambions (or Alu-fiends, the female equivalent). Successive generations between a first-generation half-fiend and a mortal then produced Tieflings. 

