#spr2 "ForgottenRealms/corruptelementalwatermedium2.tga"
#name "Corrupt Medium Water Elemental"
#descr "Corrupt Water Elementals were similar to their normal variety, but hailed from the dark waters of the abyssal seas. Infused with the corrupt water of Wastriliths, they are able to regenerate themselves while underwater, have improved darkvision and combat skills in darkness, and have greater overall physical structure, or HP. 

These elementals typically resembled a cresting wave of water, albeit with roiling demonic eddies that sucked in the light around them. They much preferred fighting in bodies of water. Acid as well as bludgeoning and piercing weaponry was ineffective against water elementals. 

